<Prose
  title="Privacy"
  kicker="Legal"
  lede="What we collect, why, and what you can ask us to do about it."
>
  <p class="draft">
    This is a working draft for a product that hasn't launched. It needs a legal review before
    anyone relies on it.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    On this website we collect only what you give us, such as the details in the contact form. We
    don't run advertising trackers.
  </p>
  <p>
    When Slide launches, account holders will give us account details, and calls handled through
    Slide will produce call records and, if enabled, recordings. Customers decide what is recorded.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To run the service and answer your messages.</li>
    <li>To keep the service secure and fix problems.</li>
    <li>Never to sell your data.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal data we hold about you. Use the
    <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and we'll respond.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this changes in a way that matters, we'll update the date at the top and say so plainly.</p>
</Prose>
